  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I spent my youth living on the lowest rung of Marleybone society. I honestly thought when I left I would do better.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-DREAM_088.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560424,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But I'm still a product of their world, aren't I? I brought their methods here. I marked my territory and exploited it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-DREAM_089.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560424,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But it was only in search of what I saw in the Dreaming that I employed those methods. Is the relation causative or was I always this way deep down?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-DREAM_090.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560424,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I can change. Reclaim my Resort for the plan Roz and Morp put together, treat my workers better than Cane did. Yes, perhaps. Let's continue on.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-DREAM_091.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560424,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You've guessed it, yes? What the Old One was inspired to create here?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC03-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He never shut-mouthed about it! He scared the olds so much they made the Barrier to stops it happening again.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_KoalaRider_BaseF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Furryosa_WL-DREAM_041.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560425,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And they were right to be afraid. When the Old One left here, he created his World Synthesizer. With it, he rent the Spiral to build his Lemuria.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_110.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
